{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, חֲוָה","hw":"חֲוָה","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חֲוָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. Pa. Haph.</strong> (M<sup>§ 65 c</sup>) <strong>declare (</strong>𝔗 Syriac; BH III. <span dir=\"rtl\">[חָוָה]</span> (late)<strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Pa.</strong>  c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּשְׁרָא</span> (or equiv.): Impf. 3 ms. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחַוִּנַּ֫נִי</span> (sf. pers. indir. obj.) <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">Dn 5:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחַוִּנַּהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:11\" href=\"/Daniel.2.11\">2:11</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">קֳדָם</span> pers.); 1 s. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחַוֶּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:24\" href=\"/Daniel.2.24\">2:24</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">ל</span> pers.), 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְחַוֶּה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:4\" href=\"/Daniel.2.4\">4</a>.<br><strong>Haph.</strong>  usually c. acc. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּשְׁרָא</span> (or equiv.): Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְהַחֲוֶה</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">Dn 5:12</a>; 2 mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּהַחֲוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:6\" href=\"/Daniel.2.6\">2:6</a>, sf. (of indir. obj.) <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּהַחֲוֻנַּ֫נִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:9\" href=\"/Daniel.2.9\">9</a>; 1 pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְהַחֲוֶה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:7\" href=\"/Daniel.2.7\">7</a>; Imv. mpl. sf. (of indir. obj.) <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחֲוֹ֑נִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:6\" href=\"/Daniel.2.6\">6</a>; Inf. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהַחֲוָיָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:10\" href=\"/Daniel.2.10\">10</a> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:15\" href=\"/Daniel.5.15\">5:15</a>; + ל pers. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:16\" href=\"/Daniel.2.16\">2:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:27\" href=\"/Daniel.2.27\">27</a>; c. acc. of signs and wonders <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:32\" href=\"/Daniel.3.32\">3:32</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, אַחֲוָיָה²","prev":"BDB Aramaic, אֲחִידָה²"}